# 0j_sand_hall: GunTurret bases u044f/u044f, tops u0453/u0453. Scan both parts, force the base FSM states and the top's
# PowerDown/PowerUp, hurt and kill the top, then leave so the leash runs out (Withdraw).
# Run: BUILD=build-port-cov tools/cov/run.sh tools/cov/specs/gunturret.py <out> 42b935e4,0j_sand_hall --con <this> --fast --frames 3400
@f300 god 1; give missile 50
@f320 scan u0453 15 300
@f330 scan u044f 15 300
@f600 fsm u044f IntoPan
@f700 fsm u044f PanLeft
@f800 fsm u044f PanRight
@f900 fsm u044f AttackExit
@f1000 fsm u044f Flinch
@f1100 fsm u044f CloseDoor
@f1200 fsm u044f OpenDoor
@f1300 fsm u044f Withdraw
@f1400 fsm u0453 PowerDown
@f1500 fsm u0453 PowerUp
@f1550 fsm u044f Attack
@f1600 damage u0453 5
@f1700 damage u0453 5 missile
@f1800 fsm u044f Patrol
@f1900 statecall u044f IntoPan 0
@f1902 statecall u044f IntoPan 1 0.016
@f1904 statecall u044f IntoPan 2
@f1910 statecall u044f AttackExit 0
@f1912 statecall u044f AttackExit 1 0.016
@f1914 statecall u044f AttackExit 2
@f1920 statecall u044f Withdraw 0
@f1922 statecall u044f Withdraw 1 0.016
@f1924 statecall u044f Withdraw 2
@f2000 kill u0453
@f2200 obj u044f; obj u0453
@f2300 tp 430 -180 18
@f2900 obj u044f; obj u044f
@f3000 kill u0453
@f3300 objs GunTurret
